nk, there will also be an additional effect:\n\t\t* Critters will be instantly killed\n\t\t* +50%% critical chance against Normal rank\n\t\t* +25%% critical chance against Elites or Bosses\n\t\tAll affected foes will get the wet effect.\n\t\tAt most, it will affect %d foes.\n\t\tIf you are yourself Frozen, it will instantly be destroyed.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"粉碎视野内所有被冻结的目标，造成 %0.2f 寒冷伤害。\n\t\t根据目标品级，还会产生额外效果：\n\t\t* 小生物会被立即杀死\n\t\t* 对普通品级目标的暴击率 +50%%\n\t\t* 对精英或首领的暴击率 +25%%\n\t\t所有受影响的敌人都会获得湿润效果。\n\t\t最多影响 %d 个敌人。\n\t\t如果你自己被冻结，你的冻结效果会被立即摧毁。\n\t\t伤害随法术强度提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b54fe1106a608ecab5c8e2581b756f5824727f87b11391ab76d0df9578a8d361","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"998e5fe304cf8ee3c2825eabc9b2a788cdfe4f7384479951300bc560af001c42","logical_entry_identity":"afbda53d8d68a8812ff289f568863fae3e7cc7ed6357a269f57f1f1101f746b9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Constricted","source_tag":"_t","target":"缠绕"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"95de3820f6eec65220aa12c21513fa5e9aca99c8cc9c2b0f783c8c42487bc3d6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"99904e4f8d7e124ae039f5d65e3721c2858caea637c1ac091c6f81d754ea02f9","logical_entry_identity":"b7fbc3ffb1626d8b504b45e9939ea78c849d46ece3472b11800d6aa30fa6cddf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"tanned","source_tag":"_t","target":"被烈日曝晒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"972fec15ab90f1762f40df041fbdabac0d4e668154b4b5e3537c4fa04b004e9c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"99904e9b78446bb783d2613c50aa153ee2f76a1da6fdf7fb5ce0256a8a64fed7","logical_entry_identity":"ff6d9386f947a80d4225447eb909cd72acc207506be4c4e555c9ff49a96a2370","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Focus your will into a powerful thrust of your telekinetically-wielded weapon to impale your target and then viciously rip it free.\n\t\tThis deals %d%% weapon damage and then causes the victim to bleed for %0.1f Physical damage over fo